---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import StatStrip from '../components/khensu/StatStrip.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="khensu.ñü’s website sets no cookies and runs no analytics. The app keeps your data on your devices.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">privacy</p>
      <h1>We can’t sell your data.<br />We don’t have it.</h1>
      <StatStrip
        items={[
          { n: 0, label: 'Cookies, analytics or trackers on this site' },
          { n: 0, label: 'Names, phone numbers or emails in the app' },
          { n: 20, unit: 's', label: 'The longest a push token is held, in memory only' },
          { n: 16, label: 'Privacy laws met, from GDPR to POPIA' },
        ]}
      />
      <p class="lede">Your messages, calls, payments and files stay readable only on your devices.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>khensu.ñü sets no cookies and runs no analytics, trackers or third-party scripts. Pages are static files served through Google Cloud’s content delivery network, which handles your request the way any web host does; we don’t log visits.</p>
      <h2>The app</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Messages, calls, payments and files are post-quantum end-to-end encrypted. Only the people in a conversation can read them.</li>
        <li>The network can’t see who talks to whom, and the people who run it can’t either.</li>
        <li>Search, summaries and answers come from private AI that runs only on your device. There are no AI nodes or servers for your data to leak to.</li>
        <li>No iCloud, no Siri, no server-side processing of any kind. Only you have your data.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Privacy law</h2>
      <p>khensu.ñü meets GDPR, UK GDPR, the ePrivacy Directive, Switzerland’s nFADP, CCPA/CPRA and every US state privacy law, COPPA, Brazil’s LGPD, Canada’s PIPEDA and Québec Law 25, Japan’s APPI, South Korea’s PIPA, and the privacy laws of Australia, New Zealand, India, Singapore and South Africa. It meets them by not having your data: no names, phone numbers or emails in the app, no sale, sharing or profiling, and nothing readable on any server.</p>
      <p>Every right is already in your hands. Export or delete everything from the app; your devices hold the only readable copies. See the data inventory, your rights, the standards we meet and more on <a href="/compliance">Compliance</a>.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@elliottwave.studio?subject=khensu.nu%20privacy">hello@elliottwave.studio</a>. khensu.ñü is made by Elliott Wave LLC.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head .lede {
    margin: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem) 0 0;
  }
</style>
